  m_text: '1. Purpose of the Application



    GrammaTag is an Android-based e-learning
    application developed to support Grade 3 learners in improving English grammar
    skills through video-based lessons, gamified activities, exercises, rewards,
    and achievements. The application is intended solely for educational purposes
    and serves as a supplementary learning tool alongside classroom instruction.

'
