  m_text: '3. User Information



    To use the application, learners may be required
    to provide:



    First Name

    Last Name

    Age

    Sex/Gender



    This
    information is used only for:



    Learner identification

    Personalized
    avatar display

    Progress monitoring

    Certificate generation within the
    application'
