  m_text: '4. Data Privacy and Storage



    GrammaTag respects user privacy and
    ensures responsible handling of learner information.



    All learner information
    is stored locally on the device using an offline database.

    The application
    does not collect, upload, or share personal information online.

    No internet
    connection is required to use the application.

    All saved data is automatically
    removed once the application is uninstalled from the device.'
